      "category": "Text",
      "text": "May I urge that you give Dr. Kogel and Mr. Monaghan every cooperation toward the end that the needs of our armed forces and our hospitals be met at this critical time. We on the home front must supply the blood that is needed to help save the lives of those who are fighting for the preservation of our principles and ideals.",
